  '<p class="gd-p">Keep your details up to date, read our notices, and know how to take a car out of the program.</p><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-notifications" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Notifications</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Account &gt; Notifications lists our messages: trips that are complete, payments and listing news, with your email preferences beside them. We do not email you when a booking comes in or changes, because many bookings are cancelled: the bookings coming up are always under Cars &gt; Bookings. We email you when a trip is complete and the car is back (the dates, the days, the distance driven when it was recorded and your share of the trip; while your share is not shown to you yet, the email says it will show on your next statement), and once a week.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Mark as read</b> on one, or <b class="gd-ui">Mark all as read</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/notifications</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/692"><img src="/guides/img/owner-14-notifications-desktop-8e58b95e.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="692"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:20.1%;top:22.7%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-your-profile" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your profile</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Update your phone and address, then press Save. To change the email you sign in with, press <b class="gd-ui">Change my email</b> under Sign-in: type the new address, open the link we send to it (the old address is told too), and your email changes everywhere.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">On your agreements shows your legal name and how you are enrolled. A change to these means new agreements, so call or message us.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/profile</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/872"><img src="/guides/img/owner-15-profile-desktop-874dd23d.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="872"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:12.2%;top:84.7%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:73.4%;top:21.2%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-texts-or-email" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Texts or email</h2><p class="gd-p">On <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, under <b class="gd-ui">Messages</b>, choose <b class="gd-ui">Email</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Text</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Both</b>: completed trips, payouts, invoices and documents to sign by a short text with a link. Texts need a phone you verified with a code. Statements, invoices and signed documents are always emailed too. Reply STOP to any text to stop them.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-take-a-car-out-of-the-program" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Take a car out of the program</h2><p class="gd-p">You give 30 days&#39; notice for that car only. Your other cars stay in.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open Cars and the car. Read Leaving: when the notice ends and what happens to your last fees.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Give notice</b>. Add a Reason (optional).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Give exit notice</b>. The car&#39;s page then shows its exit date.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer when one of your cars is booked, when a booking changes, for payouts and payments, incidents and documents to sign.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>. Under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications when your browser asks.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>, choose the topics. Your choice applies to all your devices.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> shows one. <b class="gd-ui">Turn off on this device</b> stops them there; <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes another device off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">Once your application is approved, your portal asks once whether to turn alerts on: press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on</b>, or <b class="gd-ui">Not now</b> (it is not asked again until a later approval). On a phone, once the CarmaCars app is in the stores, the invitation offers <b class="gd-ui">Download the CarmaCars app</b> instead.</p><p class="gd-p">On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>), then open it from there and turn alerts on. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-delete-my-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Delete my account</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Yes, delete my account</b>. We settle your cars, payouts and invoices first (a car under your agreement leaves the program with 30 days&#39; notice), then delete your account and email you. <b class="gd-ui">Keep my account</b> withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-your-name-and-password-release-34" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your name and password (release 34)</h2><p class="gd-p">Open Profile. <b class="gd-ui">Save my display name</b> changes how you are greeted, at once. Your legal name is the one on your signed agreements, so it is not edited freely: press <b class="gd-ui">Request a name change</b>, write the full name and why, and an Admin approves it. Until then the name on file stays. To change your email, use Change my email under Sign-in; to add or change your phone, use the phone box under Sign-in (we text a code). <b class="gd-ui">Change my password</b> sends you to the password page.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-your-week-every-monday-release-41" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your week, every Monday (release 41)</h2><p class="gd-p">Every Monday morning (about 9:00 Toronto time) you get one email, only if there was something to tell. For each car: the trips completed last week with their dates and your share (a trip whose amount is not shown to you yet says it is on your statement), your confirmed bookings in the next 14 days (dates only), and your earnings so far this month, which are provisional until your statement. Only bookings that count toward your revenue are listed. Nothing to set up; it is on by default.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-choose-your-notifications-release-48" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Choose your notifications (release 48)</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Notifications</b> lists each kind of notification we send you, with a switch for <b class="gd-ui">Push</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Email</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Text</b>. A switch is saved the moment you move it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">How often</b>: <b class="gd-ui">Instant</b> sends each one as it happens. <b class="gd-ui">Daily summary</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Weekly summary</b> holds the optional emails and sends them as one email in the morning.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Quiet hours</b>: turn them on and set the times. Optional phone alerts and texts wait until the quiet hours end.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Turn every optional notification off</b> stops them all at once. You still see every message in your portal.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">The kinds under <b class="gd-ui">Always on</b> cannot be switched off: security and sign-in codes, legal and agreement notices, invoices and fees, statements, payouts and receipts, and incidents on your car.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">If a text cannot be sent, the same message comes by email instead, so nothing is lost.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">New bookings on your cars</b> is off to start with, because many bookings change before the trip. Turn it on if you want to hear about each one.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-tracker-alerts-release-48" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Tracker alerts (release 48)</h2><p class="gd-p">These start when your tracker is installed. Until then each one says so, and your choice is kept.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Notifications</b>, under <b class="gd-ui">Tracker alerts</b>, each alert has its own switches.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">On to start with: <b class="gd-ui">Possible theft</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Tracker disconnected or tampered with</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Crash or impact</b>, and <b class="gd-ui">At an impound lot, auto shop or shipping port</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Off to start with: <b class="gd-ui">Vehicle health warning</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Over 180 km/h</b> and the <b class="gd-ui">Weekly driving summary</b> (speeding, hard braking and acceleration, late-night trips, and kilometres against the allowance). Turn on the ones you want.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">An alert names your car and what happened. It never names the renter or the booking. CarmaCars gets the same alert and acts on it.</div></li></ol></div></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('investor', 'profile-and-notices', 'chapter', 'statements', 'Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.

## Contact details

Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To change your email, press **Change my email**: we send a link to the new address and tell the old one, and it changes when the link is opened. To update the rest, ask us; we confirm by phone.

## Change how returns are handled

1. Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.
2. Press **Send the notice**. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.

![](/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg "phone; size: 390 170")

## Bank account and transfers

1. To change the account we pay, press **Ask to change the bank account**. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.
2. To transfer an investment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press **Send the request**. A transfer needs CarmaCars'' written consent.
3. You see "Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing." We confirm each request by email.

## Two-step sign-in (recommended)

1. At the bottom of Account, press **Set up two-step sign-in**.
2. Scan the code with your authenticator app.
3. Type the 6 digits and press **Continue**. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.

Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when a return is paid, a statement is ready or we send you a notice. Open **Account**, then under **Phone alerts** press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications. Choose the topics under **What to alert me about**. On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**) and turn alerts on from there.

## Delete my account

**Account**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. An investment still under contract is settled first, as your agreement says; then we delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.

## Your name and password (release 34)
Open Profile. **Save my display name** changes how you are greeted, at once. Your legal name is the one on your signed agreements, so it is not edited freely: press **Request a name change**, write the full name and why, and an Admin approves it. Until then the name on file stays. To change your email, use Change my email under Sign-in; to add or change your phone, use the phone box under Sign-in (we text a code). **Change my password** sends you to the password page.', 'Account', 'Contact details, notices about returns and bank account, transfers, two-step sign-in.',
  'Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.

## Contact details

Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To change your email, press **Change my email**: we send a link to the new address and tell the old one, and it changes when the link is opened. To update the rest, ask us; we confirm by phone.

## Change how returns are handled

1. Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.
2. Press **Send the notice**. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.

![](/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg "phone; size: 390 170")

## Bank account and transfers

1. To change the account we pay, press **Ask to change the bank account**. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.
2. To transfer an investment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press **Send the request**. A transfer needs CarmaCars'' written consent.
3. You see "Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing." We confirm each request by email.

## Two-step sign-in (recommended)

1. At the bottom of Account, press **Set up two-step sign-in**.
2. Scan the code with your authenticator app.
3. Type the 6 digits and press **Continue**. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.

Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when a return is paid, a statement is ready or we send you a notice. Open **Account**, then under **Phone alerts** press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications. Choose the topics under **What to alert me about**. On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**) and turn alerts on from there.

## Delete my account

**Account**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. An investment still under contract is settled first, as your agreement says; then we delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.

## Your name and password (release 34)
Open Profile. **Save my display name** changes how you are greeted, at once. Your legal name is the one on your signed agreements, so it is not edited freely: press **Request a name change**, write the full name and why, and an Admin approves it. Until then the name on file stays. To change your email, use Change my email under Sign-in; to add or change your phone, use the phone box under Sign-in (we text a code). **Change my password** sends you to the password page.

## Choose your notifications (release 48)

1. **Account**, under **Notification preferences**, lists each kind of notification we send you, with a switch for **Push**, **Email** and **Text**. A switch is saved the moment you move it.
2. **How often**: **Instant** sends each one as it happens. **Daily summary** or **Weekly summary** holds the optional emails and sends them as one email in the morning.
3. **Quiet hours**: turn them on and set the times. Optional phone alerts and texts wait until the quiet hours end.
4. **Turn every optional notification off** stops them all at once. You still see every message in your portal.
5. The kinds under **Always on** cannot be switched off: security and sign-in codes, legal and agreement notices, statements and payments.
6. If a text cannot be sent, the same message comes by email instead, so nothing is lost.
',
  '<p class="gd-p">Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.</p><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-contact-details" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Contact details</h2><p class="gd-p">Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To change your email, press <b class="gd-ui">Change my email</b>: we send a link to the new address and tell the old one, and it changes when the link is opened. To update the rest, ask us; we confirm by phone.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-change-how-returns-are-handled" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Change how returns are handled</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send the notice</b>. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/170"><img src="/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="170"></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-bank-account-and-transfers" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Bank account and transfers</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">To change the account we pay, press <b class="gd-ui">Ask to change the bank account</b>. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">To transfer an inv